Each Silver model reads its Bronze table with `{{ '{{' }} ref('...') {{ '}}' }}`, which also tells dbt the build order. Rows that break a data quality rule are filtered out in `WHERE`, and the tests in `schema.yml` (Task 2) check what is left.

