!!! info "Filter, test, or warn"
    A `WHERE` condition removes bad rows. A dbt test with default severity stops `dbt build` when it fails, the same as `ON VIOLATION FAIL UPDATE` in a declarative pipeline.{% for w in warn_rules %} The `{{ w.rule }}` rule on `{{ w.table }}` is a test with `severity: warn`: it reports violations without removing rows.{% endfor %}

